face, and it\u2019s the restaurant\u2019s job to worry about safely accessing/modifying the restaurant.  The McGoogles implementation will have all the locking and synchronization (and no threading!). It should ensure that all variables are modified correctly and safely, and that the restaurant is never above capacity. It should also ensure that all orders were fulfilled (number of orders == number of expected orders).","topics":[],"score":2115,"global_rank":168008},{"name":"halfak/WMF-Fundraising-task","owner":"halfak","html_url":"https://github.com/halfak/WMF-Fundraising-task","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":4,"issues":0,"language":"R","description":"A modeling task to be performed by applicants to a position at the Wikimedia Foundation ","topics":[],"score":2115,"global_rank":168010},{"name":"katplush/capstone","owner":"katplush","html_url":"https://github.com/katplush/capstone","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":25,"language":"Vue","description":"WATS4030 Capstone Project","topics":[],"score":2115,"global_rank":168024},{"name":"martingkelly/airquality","owner":"martingkelly","html_url":"https://github.com/martingkelly/airquality","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Arduino","description":"Arduino air quality meter using the Sainsmart TGS2602","topics":[],"score":2115,"global_rank":168038},{"name":"Zferg/security_challenge_notes","owner":"Zferg","html_url":"https://github.com/Zferg/security_challenge_notes","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"My Security Challenge Notes","topics":[],"score":2114.4,"global_rank":168040},{"name":"jessiececilya/ct-image-processing-denoising","owner":"jessiececilya","html_url":"https://github.com/jessiececilya/ct-image-processing-denoising","stars":2,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":null,"topics":[],"score":2114.4,"global_rank":168041},{"name":"cornerstonian/git-practice","owner":"cornerstonian","html_url":"https://github.com/corners